	(text "System-5 bus driver card Rev B (BUSDRV-B), one sheet per functional block:\n  sheet 2  Expanders      TWO MCP23017 I/O EXPANDERS ON THE SYSTEM-5 BUS\n  sheet 3  Nano           ARDUINO NANO: I2C, EXPANDER RESET, BUS POWER SENSE, SPARE HEADER\n  sheet 4  Power          POWER, DECOUPLING, LED\n\nRedrawn 2026-10-26 from the board netlist; proven pin for pin against it (gen_schematic.py).\n\nEvery net of a sheet is a pin of its sheet symbol here, labelled with the net's name. Above a dashed line:\nthe nets the sheet shares with other sheets (left: it reads them, right: it drives them). Below it: nets\ndrawn on that sheet only. VCC and GND are power symbols on the sheets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ff0253fc-c0e6-5706-8783-5a02840186e4"))
